  "body": "## VEL-CI-OPT-001 — owner-authorized correction round (Refs #69)\n\nLatest exact submission SHA and live draft/full results: [append-only evidence ledger](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/pull/70#issuecomment-6224103593).\n\n**Draft and unmerged.** Implements the [bounded owner-authorized correction](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/issues/69#issuecomment-6224002164) responding to [ChatGPT's independent review of b713d94](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/pull/70#issuecomment-6223732687). No PR68, billing/admin, cloud or merge changes.\n\n### Draft-aware checks and merge eligibility\n\nOrdinary draft updates run inexpensive governance/provenance, negative policy tests and checksum-pinned actionlint; builds and disposable integration are deferred. **Draft advisory governance may pass, while the unchanged Vellistry CI gate deliberately completes BLOCKED/FAILURE.** It is not skipped, pending or a merge-eligible green. The GitHub workflow failure for that advisory run is intentional, not hidden with continue-on-error.\n\nReady PRs (including ready_for_review, synchronize and edited/base changes) use conservative whole-diff classification. Unknown/auth/backend/shared frontend/SQL/CI/lockfile paths retain applicable real security and recovery. Main and explicit workflow_dispatch run full; full verification is available on this unmerged branch, without toggling draft status. The gate independently derives mode/flags from the exact event/head and rejects forged advisory output, missing metadata and failed/cancelled/missing/applicable-skipped checks.\n\nOne primary automatic workflow, one frozen application install/build path and all25 original manual archive job bodies remain. Original K2/K2B order, local-only/deletion/SQL-availability guards, author-isolation and rollback controls are preserved. PR68's proposed privilege source is absent from main; its skip is not a privilege PASS.\n\n### Governed amendment and evidence\n\nOriginal VEL-TASK/CP-0006 is retained; **immutable CP0006 is unchanged**. The existing schema maps one task to one pack, so unique child VEL-TASK/CP-0007 pins this correction after committing authorization/review/plan sources at1a4f190, before CI edits. CP0007 was generated and validated, then committed at9e5f912. This is a same-session continuation, not an independent cold start. No validator/governance relaxation was made.\n\n[Canonical EB0006](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/blob/codex/vel-ci-opt-001/docs/agent-workflow/execution-bundles/VEL-EB-0006.md) prominently links the current external ledger and child amendment.\n[Correction EB0007](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/blob/codex/vel-ci-opt-001/docs/agent-workflow/execution-bundles/VEL-EB-0007.md) records scope, tests, limits and rollback.\n[Usage report](https://github.com/Ben-001-sys/Vellistry/blob/codex/vel-ci-opt-001/docs/reports/VEL-CI-OPT-001-USAGE-2026-10-16.md) reconciles b713d945aa06a5fce6a5b9f63a0a9fdcaa4b88ee/run38958548133/184 observed seconds against296 old-main seconds (37.84% lower observation), preserving4259620/run38956662940/232seconds as historical. Neither is billed usage; general savings targets remain unproven.\n\n36 local policy tests pass, including real Git histories, actual advisory CLI blocking and forged-draft-on-ready CLI rejection. Before/after failures are retained. All26 workflows pass actionlint; automated Linux asset download now verifies a pinned SHA256. Final corrected SHA must have both a real draft advisory run and a real explicitly dispatched full run, recorded in the linked ledger. Prior b713 runs are not relabeled as new verification.\n\n### Holds\n\nChatGPT independent exact-head review and owner approval remain pending. Required merge-check name and protections are unchanged; read-only APIs reported no active main rule. Ready/main transitions remain scenario tests because no readiness promotion or merge is authorized. The inherited native-Windows R01 fixture issue, hosted/private-pilot JWT risks and PR68 rebase/trigger reconciliation remain separate. Historical source/tests/evidence remain reproducible; no accepted product or release gate is promoted.\r\n",
